cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the article and the archived version below."
title: "FBO-DNVP: Fuzzy–Bayesian Optimization of dynamic natural ventilation protocols"
abstract: >-
  R code, EnergyPlus models, monitoring data and evaluation logs of a
  Fuzzy–Bayesian Optimization (FBO) framework that tunes the five setpoints of a
  dynamic natural ventilation protocol for a case-study classroom in Seville
  (Spain). Includes the two-track model calibration (thermal and CO2), the
  hierarchical Mamdani scoring system, the Gaussian-process Bayesian optimizer
  and the NSGA-II and fixed-threshold benchmarks.
